WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
Your right hand in your left hand.

2
00:00:02.618 --> 00:00:05.378
And you're going to place it like a sword there,

3
00:00:05.418 --> 00:00:05.738
in your belly.

4
00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:07.238
Right here, just like that.

5
00:00:07.278 --> 00:00:09.138
To have control here over the hara.

6
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.310
And you're going to start by breathing into your

7
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:12.700
belly.

8
00:00:13.545 --> 00:00:16.175
So I'm going to inhale, I'm going to exhale through

9
00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.004
my mouth, like this.

10
00:00:23.678 --> 00:00:26.315
I hold my breath for 10 seconds, on the exhale.

11
00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:33.626
And then, I inhale like that.

12
00:00:48.835 --> 00:00:51.875
Now, you need to practice this exercise 3 times,

13
00:00:51.915 --> 00:00:52.544
then 30 times.

14
00:00:53.769 --> 00:00:55.569
You'll need to increase over time.

15
00:00:55.609 --> 00:00:56.729
You can increase. up to

16
00:01:00.349 --> 00:01:02.119
one to two minutes without breathing.

